<title>JAPAN: Japan Dec refinery operating rates at 84.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Japan Dec refinery operating rates at 84.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The utilisation rate of Japanese oil refineries was at 84.9 percent in December, up from 83.3 percent in the same month in 1995 and up from 82.2 percent in November, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Crude throughput amounted to 22.1 million kilolitres in December, up 2.0 percent from the same month in 1995 and up 6.9 percent from November, MITI said.</p>
<p>Japan's oil companies currently have a combined refining capacity of 5.3 million barrels-per-stream-day.</p>
</text>
